> isqrt4(x: u4) = isqrt(x)
> what is the minimal gate network for isqrt4 using arm64 with sha3?
  ucas: gates isqrt4 basis a64sha
gates for isqrt4: 4 input bits -> 4 output bits (2 constant), basis a64sha
  minimal: cost 3, 3 steps (no program of cost <= 2 exists; 4576 candidates searched)
  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs
  t0 = or(x0, x1)                = x0 | x1
  t1 = or(x2, x3)                = x2 | x3
  t2 = bsl(x2, x3, t0)           = x2 & x3 | ~x2 & t0
  r3 = 0
  r2 = 0
  r1 = t1
  r0 = t2
